WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:07,260
Xiao Zhang, you have stocked up a lot of things at home before.

2
00:00:07,260 --> 00:00:11,060
The blood disaster is serious now. You can't be used as a negative example.

3
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:18,540
Aunt Lin, no one knows how long this bloody disaster will last.

4
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:21,620
What if it takes a long time and everyone won’t have anything to eat?

5
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:23,220
Can you take this responsibility?

6
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:27,270
Yes, you don't let us stock up on supplies

7
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:28,950
Who will be responsible for the lack of food and drink?

8
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,670
can you afford this responsibility

9
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:34,310
There will be no shortage of supplies, and the blood disaster will soon pass.

10
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,820
And you Zhang Yi

11
00:00:36,820 --> 00:00:38,940
Don't incite people at this time

12
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,980
What you're doing is a random act of memorization.

13
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:47,780
This Zhang Yi really knows how high the sky is and how high he is.

14
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:52,410
Hahaha, it’s time like this

15
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:54,690
Spiritual women still want to be like the past

16
00:00:54,690 --> 00:00:57,250
Relying on the little power you have to dominate and prosper

17
00:00:57,250 --> 00:00:58,490
It's really ridiculous

18
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:00,730
Ouch, such a big tall hat

19
00:01:00,730 --> 00:01:02,250
I can't afford it

20
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:04,370
Don't worry, it's so cold outside

21
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:06,850
Even if you ask me to go out, I won’t go out. You can do whatever you want.

22
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:08,840
The end is coming

23
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:10,840
I don’t know how many people will die due to evil
